  "note": "SHA-256 hashes computed live from actual file bytes; repo-relative paths. Includes Qwen3-8B attempt 1 (harness failure, annotated with failure_domain; pre-annotation attempts-file sha256 eaa18cb6ce2718bc7c510d4c4de533b202694e5c04453a72989497410a8de365 is preserved in git history and in the annotation), the read-only settlement reconciliation, and NOT_TESTED records for Mistral-Nemo and Phi-4. Phase 21B.4.20 Modal H100 update: adds CPU pre-cache manifests, owner-created attempt-1 settlement waiver (hash recorded, content untouched), Qwen3-8B H100 attempt 4 evidence and its delayed-settlement reconciliation artifacts. Audit remediation: adds the three Modal H100 preflight artifacts (CPU 191936Z, GPU 195933Z blocked, GPU 205041Z allowed) and re-derives every hash from actual bytes; GENESIS_CONTROL_SET_* files belong to the earlier control-set admission phase and have their own index. Adds the CPU-only Qwen3-8B runtime-configuration analysis (2026-09-25). Canonical locked-smoke protocol canonicalization (2026-09-25): adds GENESIS_LOCKED_SMOKE_PROTOCOL and the V2 canonical-prompt Qwen analysis; the earlier analysis is annotated superseded; Mistral/Phi NOT_TESTED planned prompts canonicalized (originals preserved); matrix updated. Qwen3-8B qwen3_8b_non_thinking_v1 implementation readiness (2026-09-25): adds the byte-identical attempt-4 record snapshot and the CPU-only readiness artifact; matrix updated. Runtime-policy pin (2026-09-25): readiness artifact regenerated with the pinned policy fingerprint; matrix updated. Qwen3-8B attempt 5 (2026-09-25, owner-authorized, qwen3_8b_non_thinking_v1): adds the attempt-5 preflight/billing/raw-log artifacts and the 081417Z GPU preflight; attempts file and Qwen record re-hashed; matrix updated. Attempt-5 reasoning_mode metadata correction (2026-09-25): adds the byte-identical pre-correction attempt-5 record snapshot; Qwen record re-hashed (descriptive metadata only); matrix updated. Mistral-Nemo attempt 1 (2026-09-25, owner-authorized): adds the attempt-1 preflight/billing/raw-log/attempts/reconciliation artifacts; Mistral record re-hashed; matrix updated. Mistral audit remediation (2026-09-25): adds the byte-identical pre-correction Mistral attempt-1 snapshot; Mistral record/attempts re-hashed (conservative UNATTRIBUTED classification, settlement sync, reconstructed container proof); matrix updated. Mistral follow-up (2026-09-25): adds the CPU-only HTTP 400 root-cause analysis (decision B) and the third read-only settlement reconciliation; matrix updated. Mistral settlement finalized OBSERVED by the fourth read-only reconciliation (2026-09-25T12:06Z) via the transactional finalizer; record and attempts file re-hashed; matrix updated. Mistral attempt 2 preflight BLOCKED (2026-09-25T12:27Z): adds the blocked preflight and the read-only Modal volume-metering diagnosis.",
